# QBasic: QBasic/QuickBASIC 4.5 language reference; requirements/languages/qbasic.md
name     qbasic quickbasic qb
keyword  DIM AS INTEGER LONG SINGLE DOUBLE STRING FUNCTION SUB END IF THEN ELSE ELSEIF FOR TO STEP NEXT
keyword  DO LOOP WHILE UNTIL WEND SELECT CASE GOTO GOSUB RETURN PRINT INPUT LET CLS SCREEN DECLARE CALL
keyword  AND OR NOT MOD SHARED CONST
builtin  LEN MID$ LEFT$ RIGHT$ STR$ VAL CHR$ ASC RND TIMER INKEY$
ident-part     $%!#&
fold-case
line-comment   ' REM
string   " "
operators  +-*/\^=<>
